# A messy N-Quads file: tabs, runs of spaces, blank lines, graphs.
<https://example.com/ns#alice> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <https://example.com/ns#Person> <https://example.com/g/people> .
<https://example.com/ns#alice> <https://example.com/ns#name> "Alice"@en <https://example.com/g/people> . # her name

<https://example.com/ns#alice> <https://example.com/ns#age> "42"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:b0 <https://example.com/ns#name> "Bob" _:g1 .
# a triple term in a named graph
<https://example.com/ns#alice> <https://example.com/ns#says> <<( _:b0 <https://example.com/ns#knows> <https://example.com/ns#alice> )>> <https://example.com/g/claims> .
